flowchart TD
  %% Shorter node ids, long labels preserved for readability
  S[start]
  Q1["Are you able to report figures for the period<br>01 Jan 2025 to 31 Dec 2025?"]
  Q2["For the reporting period,<br>what was your business's total turnover?"]
  Q3["Does your business produce goods or services<br>that protect the environment?"]
  Q3a["Of total turnover, approximately what percentage<br>related to environmental goods or services?"]
  Q4["For the reporting period,<br>what was your business's expenditure on employment costs?"]
  Q5["For the reporting period,<br>what was your business's expenditure on materials,<br>goods, services, and energy products?"]
  Q6["For the reporting period,<br>what was your business's expenditure on rates,<br>duties, levies, and taxes paid to government?"]
  Q7["For the reporting period,<br>what was your business's total amounts received<br>in subsidies from UK government sources and the EU?"]
  Q8["For the reporting period,<br>what was your business's total value of all stocks held?"]
  Q9["For the reporting period,<br>what was your business's total value of capital assets<br>acquired and disposed of?"]
  Q10["For the reporting period,<br>what was your business's income from services provided<br>to parties based outside the UK?"]
  Q11["For the reporting period,<br>what was your business's expenditure on services provided<br>by parties based outside the UK?"]
  Q12["For the reporting period,<br>did your business export goods to parties based outside the UK?"]
  Q13["For the reporting period,<br>did your business import goods from parties based outside the UK?"]
  Q14["Did your business carry out any in-house<br>R&D for the reporting period, or intend to in the next period?"]
  END((END))

